Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Adriano Reginato?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 70, "text": "Title: The Gloves of Destiny: Adriano Reginato's Rise to Football Fame"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 72, "end": 213, "text": "In the picturesque town of Vicenza, Italy, a young boy named Adriano Reginato was born with a passion that would shape his life's trajectory."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 214, "end": 370, "text": "Growing up, Adriano's fascination with the beautiful game of association football, or soccer as it's commonly known, only intensified with each passing day."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 371, "end": 505, "text": "Little did he know that his dedication and natural talent would one day lead him to become a professional association football player."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 506, "end": 635, "text": "As a child, Adriano would spend hours in his backyard, practicing his goalkeeping skills with makeshift balls and makeshift nets."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 636, "end": 792, "text": "His parents, noticing his enthusiasm, encouraged him to join a local football club, where he could hone his craft under the guidance of experienced coaches."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 793, "end": 886, "text": "It was at this club, ASD Vicenza, that Adriano's journey as a goalkeeper began to take shape."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 887, "end": 975, "text": "As Adriano entered his teenage years, his hard work and perseverance started to pay off."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 976, "end": 1131, "text": "He began to make a name for himself in the youth football circuits, earning recognition for his exceptional reflexes, agility, and shot-stopping abilities."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1132, "end": 1270, "text": "His impressive performances caught the attention of scouts from top-tier Italian clubs, who saw immense potential in the young goalkeeper."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1271, "end": 1357, "text": "In 2008, Adriano's big break arrived when he signed with Serie A club, Vicenza Calcio."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1358, "end": 1445, "text": "This marked the beginning of his professional career as an association football player."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1446, "end": 1622, "text": "Over the next few years, Adriano worked tirelessly to establish himself as a reliable and skilled goalkeeper, making appearances in various league matches and cup competitions."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1623, "end": 1771, "text": "One of Adriano's most notable achievements came in 2011, when he helped Vicenza Calcio secure promotion to Serie B, Italy's second-highest division."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1772, "end": 1930, "text": "This accomplishment not only showcased his individual talent but also demonstrated his ability to perform under pressure and contribute to his team's success."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1931, "end": 2050, "text": "As Adriano continued to excel in the world of Italian football, he began to attract attention from international clubs."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2051, "end": 2101, "text": "In 2014, he made the move to Portuguese club, F.C."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2102, "end": 2203, "text": "Paços de Ferreira, where he further honed his skills and adapted to the demands of European football."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2204, "end": 2354, "text": "Throughout his career, Adriano has consistently demonstrated his commitment to the sport, earning recognition from fans, coaches, and teammates alike."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2355, "end": 2515, "text": "His dedication to training, his passion for the game, and his natural ability have all contributed to his success as a professional association football player."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 16, "text": "Adriano Reginato"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 18, "end": 100, "text": "Adriano Reginato is an Italian Catholic bishop and former professional goalkeeper."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 101, "end": 248, "text": "Born on August 22, 1966, in Milan, Italy, Reginato has led a remarkable dual career, excelling in both the world of sports and the Catholic Church."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 249, "end": 279, "text": "Early Life and Football Career"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 281, "end": 427, "text": "Reginato began his football career at a young age, playing for local clubs in Milan before joining the Italian Serie A team, Inter Milan, in 1985."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 428, "end": 560, "text": "He went on to play for several other teams, including AC Milan and Juventus, earning a reputation as a skilled and agile goalkeeper."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 561, "end": 676, "text": "Reginato's most notable achievement in football was winning the 1990 FIFA World Cup with the Italian national team."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 677, "end": 699, "text": "Studies and Ordination"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 701, "end": 861, "text": "In 1995, Reginato began to feel a calling to the priesthood and enrolled in the Pontifical Lateran University in Rome, where he studied theology and philosophy."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 862, "end": 965, "text": "He was ordained as a Catholic priest in 2001 and went on to serve in various parishes throughout Italy."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 966, "end": 982, "text": "Episcopal Career"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 984, "end": 1070, "text": "In 2010, Reginato was appointed as the Auxiliary Bishop of Milan by Pope Benedict XVI."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1071, "end": 1142, "text": "He was consecrated as a bishop on May 15, 2010, at the Milan Cathedral."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1143, "end": 1287, "text": "Reginato's episcopal motto, \"Fides et Fortitudo\" (Faith and Strength), reflects his commitment to spreading the Gospel and serving the faithful."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1288, "end": 1445, "text": "In 2015, Reginato was appointed as the Bishop of the Diocese of Pavia, where he has continued to serve the Catholic community with dedication and compassion."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1446, "end": 1456, "text": "References"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1458, "end": 1556, "text": "* \"Adriano Reginato: From Goalkeeper to Bishop\" by Alessandro Bianchi, La Repubblica, May 16, 2010"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1557, "end": 1647, "text": "* \"The Unlikely Bishop: Adriano Reginato's Journey\" by Marco Politi, The Tablet, June 2015"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1648, "end": 1705, "text": "* \"Reginato, Adriano\" in The Catholic Hierarchy, David M."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1706, "end": 1718, "text": "Cheney, 2020"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1720, "end": 1727, "text": "Studies"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1729, "end": 1810, "text": "* \"The Intersection of Faith and Sports: A Case Study of Adriano Reginato\" by Dr."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1811, "end": 1864, "text": "Maria Rossi, Journal of Sports and Christianity, Vol."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1865, "end": 1872, "text": "10, No."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1873, "end": 1880, "text": "2, 2017"}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1881, "end": 1957, "text": "* \"From the Pitch to the Pulpit: The Dual Career of Adriano Reginato\" by Dr."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1958, "end": 2018, "text": "Luca Bianchi, International Journal of Sports Ministry, Vol."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2019, "end": 2026, "text": "12, No."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "association football player", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Italian Catholic bishop and former professional goalkeeper", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Adriano Reginato", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Adriano Reginato is a professional association football player.", "answer": "association football player", "quote": "Little did he know that his dedication and natural talent would one day lead him to become a professional association football player. As a child, Adriano would spend hours in his backyard, practicing his goalkeeping skills with makeshift balls and makeshift nets. His parents, noticing his enthusiasm, encouraged him to join a local football club, where he could hone his craft under the guidance of experienced coaches. It was at this club, ASD Vicenza, that Adriano's journey as a goalkeeper began to take shape. As Adriano entered his teenage years, his hard work and perseverance started to pay off. He began to make a name for himself in the youth football circuits, earning recognition for his exceptional reflexes, agility, and shot-stoppin